    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "The stored items contain tracking data of lovebirds performing a rapid turning on a dime flight maneuver. In addition, further analyzed data like the wingbeat kinematics and the gaze orientation are included. The data structure and name information is described in the Read_me_data_description.xlsx spread sheet.\r\n\r\nAll performed experiments have been approved by the related Institutional Animal Care and Use Committee before been conducted.\r\n\r\nProvided data comes at Matlab *.mat files. Therefore, Matlab might be required to access the files. \r\n\r\nThe data is made available under the Creative Commons License for non commercial use only.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
